Depends: ohpc-filesystem, gnu15-compilers-ohpc (>= 14.1.0), intel-mpi-devel-ohpc, phdf5-gnu15-impi-ohpc, scalapack-gnu15-impi-ohpc, openblas-gnu15-ohpc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Portable Extensible Toolkit for Scientific Computation (gnu15 + impi, OpenHPC)
 PETSc is a suite of data structures and routines for the scalable
 (parallel) solution of scientific applications modeled by partial
 differential equations.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and impi MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
